    "created_at": "2016-03-30T17:10:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-30T17:10:16Z",
    "body": "A web page communicates with a service worker via fetch, which is also async. Is such operation which is initiated in a beforeunload event guaranteed to finish? If not, service worker is not suitable for auto-saving.\n\nBeacon doesn't work for offline situation, and there are data size limitaitions.\n\nBesides technical issues, Background sync and Beacon are also not solution for non-cloud app (i.e. users don't want to upload their data to the server).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
