    "created_at": "2016-03-30T17:24:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-30T17:24:42Z",
    "body": "Service workers + background sync, not just service workers.\n\nIf you don't sync to a server, you have no guarantees anyway as the user or browser can clear storage at any time.\n",
