    "created_at": "2016-03-30T19:12:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-30T19:27:30Z",
    "body": "Well, even if the async operations can finish quickly (say 1 second), I think there is no guarantee by the spec that UAs would let them finish before page unload, right? If UAs do make some guarantee here, can you spec it?\n",
